# Where the build runs
{%- set project = '<the Vercel project of one app>' if monorepo else '<the Vercel project>' %}
{%- if uat %}
{%- set production_moves = '`promote.sh run --tag <tag>`, on Jamie\'s word' %}
{%- elif release %}
{%- set production_moves = 'every merge to `main`. The release tag follows on Jamie\'s word `release`' %}
{%- else %}
{%- set production_moves = 'every merge to `main`. The merge is the release' %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if database == 'neon' %}
{%- set production_db = 'the default branch of the Neon project `' ~ slug ~ '`' %}
{%- set uat_db = 'the default branch of the Neon project `uat-' ~ slug ~ '`' %}
{%- set preview_db = 'the Neon branch `preview/<branch>` in `' ~ ('uat-' if uat else '') ~ slug ~ '`, made by the Neon integration' %}
{%- elif database == 'none' %}
{%- set production_db = 'none' %}
{%- set uat_db = 'none' %}
{%- set preview_db = 'none' %}
{%- else %}
{%- set production_db = "<production's database>" %}
{%- set uat_db = "<the UAT database, apart from production's>" %}
{%- set preview_db = '<the database a preview reads>' %}
{%- endif %}

| Environment | Address | Vercel project | Database | Moves on |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Production | <the production domain> | {{ project }} | {{ production_db }} | {{ production_moves }} |
{%- if uat %}
| UAT | <https://uat.the production domain> | {{ project }} | {{ uat_db }} | every merge to `main` |
{%- endif %}
| Preview | the pull request's Vercel preview | {{ project }} | {{ preview_db }} | every push to the branch |

This table is the one home of where the build runs. The blueprint's files read it and never
repeat it. The blueprint owns this file: `copier update` merges a new tag into it three ways,
so a cell that a person filled stays filled.
{%- if monorepo %}
A monorepo has one row per environment and Vercel project. Copy the rows of each environment
once for each app that deploys.
{%- endif %}
{%- if uat or database == 'neon' %}
Each setup stub in `.icm/intake/setup/` names the cells that it fills.
{%- endif %}
A person fills each `<…>` cell that no setup stub fills, when the project or the domain exists.
{%- if uat %}
The UAT contract: `.icm/uat/CONTEXT.md`.
{%- endif %}
{%- if database == 'neon' %}
The database contract: `.icm/database/CONTEXT.md`.
{%- endif %}
